## Usage Notes

This template is designed for comprehensive literature reviews. Adapt sections as needed based on:
- Scope of review (narrow vs broad)
- Audience (technical vs executive)
- Purpose (decision-making vs knowledge building)
- Time constraints

**Pandoc Conversion**:
```bash
# Convert to Word
pandoc literature-review.md -o literature-review.docx

# With table of contents
pandoc literature-review.md --toc --toc-depth=3 -o literature-review.docx

# With reference template
pandoc literature-review.md --reference-doc=corporate-template.docx -o literature-review.docx